      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. So it's about finding that balance between the different harmonics to keep the tone from getting muddy or too overpowering. When musicians talk about \"ghost notes\" or those strange, barely audible sounds that seem to pop up in a performance, is that related to these unstable frequencies or the higher overtones?",
